{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"uk-universal-credit UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"uk-universal-credit.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["uk-universal-credit.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Wannan yana nuna tasirin riba kawai kuma ba ya bincika halayyar ko ƙididdige cikakken kyautar Universal Credit. Yana tsammanin mafi girman kyautar kafin samun kuɗi. Tasirin ZXQPH0000QXZ yana aiki a sama da tallafin aikin da aka zaɓa: £ZXQPH0001QXZ tare da goyon bayan gida, £ZXQPH0002QXZ ba tare da goyon bayan gida ba, ko £ZXQPH0003QXZ idan babu tallafin aiki yana aiki. Kasuwanci na musamman da sauran ragewa an rufe su. Ka'idojin sune don ZXQPH0004QXZ–ZXQPH0005QXZ kuma dole ne a duba su kafin ZXQPH0006QXZ Afrilu ZXQPH0007QXZ.","record_id":"d868f2570ac5ed0d42e5d2780971b45bda2467e511028431d623dd845e375e93","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":4.2465051865000305,"source":"This illustrates the earnings taper only and does not check eligibility or calculate a full Universal Credit award. It assumes the maximum award before earnings is already known. The 55% taper applies above the selected work allowance: £427 with housing support, £710 without housing support, or £0 if no work allowance applies. Special cases and other deductions are excluded. Rules are for 2026–27 and must be reviewed before 6 April 2027.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"4a5506124846288e6347287158891c1e308abc590a854560b4a430683b0dab07","status":"needs-review","translation":"Wannan yana nuna tasirin riba kawai kuma ba ya bincika halayyar ko ƙididdige cikakken kyautar Universal Credit. Yana tsammanin mafi girman kyautar kafin samun kuɗi. Tasirin 55% yana aiki a sama da tallafin aikin da aka zaɓa: £427 tare da goyon bayan gida, £710 ba tare da goyon bayan gida ba, ko £0 idan babu tallafin aiki yana aiki. Kasuwanci na musamman da sauran ragewa an rufe su. Ka'idojin sune don 2026–27 kuma dole ne a duba su kafin 6 Afrilu 2027.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
